flowchart TD
    A[User submits garment image] --> B[POST garment imports]
    B --> C[Validate MIME extension bytes size and pixels]
    C -->|valid| D[Persist source image and manifest]
    C -->|invalid| E[HTTP 422 validation error]
    D --> F[Canonical proxy binding for immediate preview]
    D --> G[POST reconstruct]
    G --> H[Celery task routed to garment GPU queue]
    H --> I[GPU worker marks segmenting]
    I --> J[Segmentation provider]
    J --> K[Persist PNG mask artifact and segmentation quality]
    K --> L[GPU and runtime preflight]
    L -->|not eligible| M[pending reconstruction with reason]
    L -->|eligible| N[Offline reconstruction provider]
    N --> O[Mesh quality gate]
    O -->|asset skeleton rest pose anchors weights scale bounds intersections review pass| P[rigged template asset]
    O -->|missing evidence or failure| Q[pending reconstruction or failed]
    P --> R[Avatar loads approved rigged garment]
    F --> S[Avatar shows canonical category proxy]
    M --> S
    Q --> S
